  "description": "Moog Grandmother semi-modular analog synthesizer: the MIDI CC table of its manual, with the value tables it points to.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "Grandmother Manual, Version 2",
      "notes": "MIDI CC table (pages 43) read by tools/profiles/moog/read-moog-pdf.mjs from Grandmother_Manual_Version_2.pdf (sha256 07e5e0b0582759b3e0f8976e595a917ab813f773ffd258b38ece5a428f5e368a), https://cdn.inmusicbrands.com/Moog/Grandmother/Grandmother_Manual_Version_2.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/moog/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/moog/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the manual's MIDI tables, with its printed name. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "No identity check: the manual prints no Device Inquiry reply.",
    "5 knob(s) are printed as an MSB and an LSB, 0 - 16383 together; CEditor sends the MSB alone, 0 - 127, which the manual says the instrument takes by itself: MOD WHEEL (CC 1, LSB 33); MODULATION RATE (CC 3, LSB 35); GLIDE TIME (CC 5, LSB 37); ARP/SEQ RATE (CC 8, LSB 40); OSCILLATOR 2 FREQUENCY (CC 12, LSB 44)."
  ],
